    owns: "A choice that stays attributable to its subject, candidate field, constraints, evidence and policy; this domain exposes accidental forks of that authority. Every use case that matches demand with supply or chooses how a demanded result is realized onboards here, through one interface rather than its own scoring: it supplies the required outcome, the owners' objectives and time valuations, the constraints and commitments, and each candidate's consequences as readings on declared axes, then realizes and reads back the selected plan. Fabric allocation, CI runner placement, compute sold beside internal work, standing buy orders matched against a scanned marketplace, eval realization, and the demand engine's own realization and materialization choices (execution grain and partition, fusion, batching, cache versus recompute, placement; gunbc.plans.demand_engine_program section 2.2 and M4) are named consumers. A rough estimate is an admitted reading with its standing, and improving it does not create a new choosing mechanism.",
